canon = "Ch9 (Keeper 2026-11-02, [C]): the following morning she asks Alis after Lucien: on border patrol, at the stables. At the painted stables he is astride a black gelding: I'm to patrol the southern woods today... Indulge me in a hunt. [V]; I suppose I'm already dressed for a hunt. [V]; they ride out on the broad path (she on a white mare, a yew bow). Staged on foot by the horse statue in the stable yard (no gelding model yet, X); the ride is a fade. Marks are in manor_dining_table's frame (anchor at world 21, 0.9, -31.5): lucien_steps is world (-128, -18), in the yard."
